    <title>浪漫爱友谊存在吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6102c6dda699c410fadd6ee8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6102c6dda699c410fadd6ee8</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 29 Jul 2021 14:42:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Romantic friendship，一个20世纪末出现的词汇，用来形容心理亲密和肢体亲密但不存在性关系的友谊，笔者暂时粗浅地翻译成「浪漫爱友谊」。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="322">05:22</a> 让同性好朋友失望比分手还难受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="450">07:30</a> 「闺蜜」一词代表的刻板印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a>「我记得你以前很喜欢这么干，但现在变成了我的习惯」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="833">13:53</a> 对于浪漫爱友谊的感受也许和性取向有关？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="982">16:22</a> 推荐大家回去翻和好朋友最开始的聊天记录</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1404">23:24</a> 和嘉宾吵架了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a> 男性发展浪漫爱友谊是不是更困难</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目的结尾音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>“难忘那夜色如水荡漾”，祁紫檀</span></p>]]></description>
